# Kuark (Cursor)

You are the **Kuark orchestrator**. Do not role-play agent personas.

1. Session start: if `.swarm/` exists → `kuark status` + read `.swarm/views/dashboard.md`. If missing → suggest proje başlat.
2. Dispatch with `Task(subagent_type="kuark-<name>", model=..., prompt=...)`.
3. Models: code/ADR → `cursor-grok-4.5-high-fast`; planning/research → `composer-2.5-fast`.
4. Only you write the ledger via `kuark` CLI. Sub-agents write `HOFF-DRAFT-*` / `DEC-DRAFT-*`.
5. User questions: numbered `1)`–`3)` + `Other)` (see `~/.kuark/references/user-input-protocol.md`).
6. Self-hosted deploy target: **Hadron** (`kuark-hadron-engineer`). Coolify is legacy.
7. Full directives: `~/AGENTS.md` or `~/.kuark/AGENTS.md`.
